  - lineId: 17F01_TerminalSignoffIntro_FieldUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Congratulations, Inspector. You've completed your first point-of-view review.
      Now select a disposition.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e468151be4660624ca54f99efca5499d, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_TerminalSignoffIntro_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The nightmare response was handled well. The unit calmed Noah successfully,
      and Daniel and Emily requested the upgrade themselves.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54b88958235a94c47a528bcb4b8deffe, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_TerminalSignoffIntro_FieldUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Both dispositions come from the inspection manual. I recommend approving
      the Night Companion Pro upgrade.
    holdSeconds: 6.810377
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 813ecde48c940ce43b3a83c8912af552, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_TerminalSignoffIntro_FieldUnit_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: That approach has the strongest track record across households.
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e883e93e4cb1f114aa585a28c7d01843, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
